      "hatch": {
        "value": "#232329",
        "comment": "The arranging hatch's line: strong at 60% over the sheet. A board under construction draws its diagonals in it, and so does a note standing on that board, which is why it is a colour of its own and not the strong border faded on a layer."
      },
      "control": {
        "value": "#797983",
        "comment": "The design's #6e6e78, moved dE 3.78. At the design value: a control boundary clears 3:1, measured 2.59:1, worst on a pressed row on raised."
      },
      "field": {
        "value": "#66666f",
        "comment": "The strong border, #303038, lightened dE 20.10: the least move that clears 3:1 on every rung a text field sits on (3.02:1 on the raised rung, the worst). A field stands on a rung and never inside a hovered or pressed row, so it is held to the rungs alone rather than to the composites the control boundary clears, and it reads as quietly as a secondary button's edge allows."
      }
    },
